 **Limitations.**
 
-- Not run on Windows. The highlights and the rechecks are in Chromium's page engine and in the editor, the same on every system.
-- A paragraph changed by Replace shows no red lines until the caret is back in the text; then every red line is gone for about a second, as after a paste (several seconds in a very long document).
-- The limitations of 1.3.1 stand, among them: if Settings is opened within about a second of choosing Ignore All, the recheck is abandoned and the red lines far from the ignored word stay away until the caret next moves in the document.
